WEBVTT

00:13:28.779 --> 00:13:31.855
dhe kjo eshte, te dilni jashte dhe te protestoni,

00:13:31.855 --> 00:13:34.093
te flinsi per te pafoluren,

00:13:34.093 --> 00:13:35.632
dhe te flisni mbi jashteqitjen.

00:13:35.632 --> 00:13:37.586
Faleminderit.

00:13:37.586 --> 00:13:42.910
(Duartrokitje)